{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8xOTkxLS0yMDAwL0todWRhJTIwR2F3YWglMjAlMjgxOTkzJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Khuda Gawah","description":"Baadshah Khan falls in love with Benazir, a member of a rival clan who has defeated him in a game of buzkashi. Benazir will not marry him unless he brings back the head of her father's killer, Habibullah, from India. He is successful, but he must return to India. He is then tragically separated from Benazir through a series of incidents that are only resolved years later with the arrival of his daughter, Menhdi, and his release from prison.","releaseInfo":"1993","genres":["Romance","Action","Adventure","Bollywood"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/uUvUFpWfGXlgOzXgkIYwqpchh0f.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5FzWfd6jhcsbwD0moOI8wLOvhaG.jpg","imdbRating":"6.1","runtime":"193 min","cast":["Amitabh Bachchan","Sridevi","Shilpa Shirodkar","Kiran Kumar","Danny Denzongpa","Anjana Mumtaz","Beena Banerjee","Vikram Gokhale"],"director":["Mukul Anand"],"released":"1992-05-08T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Amitabh Bachchan","character":"Baadshah Khan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/u69PvpWqGkywSm0YjFiw77j9eqS.jpg"},{"name":"Sridevi","character":"Benazir / Mehndi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6wxquADm0CMYMon04uEI48ZiBBf.jpg"},{"name":"Shilpa Shirodkar","character":"Insp. Henna Ranveer Sethi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kMteZPdvUd2kwTICukJ6KVVdQdL.jpg"},{"name":"Kiran Kumar","character":"Pasha","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vnpgMjRmNXl9r6LE2N5RJ1F5gD6.jpg"},{"name":"Danny Denzongpa","character":"Khuda Baksh","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xDNLtgG8iDXxNRvSDjpuNSNfKvX.jpg"},{"name":"Anjana Mumtaz","character":"Salma Mirza","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/c6kW0RsId7p3uD5Fe1IZiloht7Y.jpg"},{"name":"Beena Banerjee","character":"Laxmi Sethi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bpz1mRlbVEYtIgRVoG